        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Sawn timber, softwood, raw, air dried, u=20%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Sawn timber, softwood, raw, air dried, u=20%, at plant
The  volume refers to the wood not including the bark.;
Synonyms: Fichte, Spruce; 
UUID: f381d335-64a5-3da9-9d9b-669660a008f3
Natural drying at the sawmill. Land use is accounted for. Air emissions released from the wood are not accounted for because the same emissions would occur if the wood would not be used.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Naturaly dried on 5 m high staples for 2 years. Shrinkeage for spruce
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the volume change of spruce is the same as for other softwood is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f381d335-64a5-3da9-9d9b-669660a008f3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
